==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*hirvas}}, borrowed from {{der|fi|ine-bsl-pro|*śirwas}}. Cognate with {{cog|se|sarvvis}}, which must have either been borrowed directly from Balto-Slavic or (more likely) come via Finnic before *š became h.

